#: FirstStart.cpp:12 SpoolerConfig.cpp:43
msgid "Select your spooling system"
msgstr "Kies jou spoelling stelsel"

#: FirstStart.cpp:16
msgid ""
"<qt>Please select the spooling system you use. Most systems use the "
"<b>BSD</b> spooler. So if you don't know which spooler is installed on your "
"system, BSD is probably a good choice.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Asseblief kies die spoelling stelsel jy gebruik. Mees sisteme gebruik die "
"<b>Bsd</b> spoeler. Sodat as jy moet nie ken wat spoeler is geïnstalleer op jou "
"stelsel, Bsd is waarskynlik 'n goeie keuse.</qt>"

